"우리 <<= $wrenHeistDance.profits is "50/50" ? "반반" : $wrenHeistDance.profits is "60/40" ? "육대사" : "칠대삼">>【으로로】 나누기로 했지?"
<<if (C.npc.Wren.love gte 40 and $wrenHeistDance.profits is "60/40") or (C.npc.Wren.love gte 20 and $wrenHeistDance.profits is "70/30")>>
